                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (\infty,1)
          %p Alternatively, the local transformations can be characterized as follows
          %p
            it turns out the local transformations are the right half of a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/factorization+system"} factorization system
            on
            = succeed "," do
