                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mi op
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Topos_{geom}(\mathcal{X}, \mathcal{K})^{op}
            that is functorial in
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi 𝒳
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{X}
            \. Given such we have another way of saying “local transformation”: this is the non-full subcategory
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
