            on all objects and on the right part of the factorization system.
          %p
            And this is indeed the same kind of datum as an admissibility structure on a geometry (example 1.4.4): in the case that
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
