          %h2#examples Examples
          %h3#classes_of_examples Classes of examples
          %h4#CanonicalStructureSheafOnObjectsInBigTopos Canonical structure sheaves on objects in the big topos
          %p
            For
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi 𝒢
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{G}
            a
